LAA MOHAMMADIN WA AALE MOHAMMADIN WA BALLIGH-HUM A’NNEE TAHIYYATAN KASEERATAN WA SALAAMAN ASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA RASOOLIL LAAHE AHSANAL LAAHO LAKAL A’ZAAA-A FEE WALADEKAL HUSAYNE ASSALAAMO A’LAYKE YAA FAATEMATO AHSANAL LAAHO LAKIL A’ZAAA-A FEE WALADEKIL HUSAYNE ASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA AMEERAL MOA-MENEENA AHSANAL LAAHO LAKAL A’ZAAA-A FEE WALADEKAL HUSAYNE ASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA ABAA MOHAMMADENIL HASANA AHSANAL LAAHO LAKAL A’ZAAA-A FEE AKHEEKAL HUSAYNE YAA MAWLAAYA YAA ABAA A’BDIL LAAHE ANAA ZAYFUL LAAHE WA ZAYFOKA WA JAARUL LAAHE WA JAAROKA WA LEKULLE ZAYFIN WA JAARIN QERAN WA QERAA-YA FEE HAAZAL WAQTE AN AN TS-ALAL LAAHA SUBHAANAHU WA TA-A’ALAA AN YARZOQANEE FAKAAKA RAQABATEE MENAN NAARE INNAHU SAMEE-U’D DO-A’AAA-E QAREEBUM MOJEEBUN.\nPeace be upon you, O inheritor of Adam, the elite choice of Allah. Peace be upon you, O inheritor of Noah, the Prophet of Allah. Peace be upon you, O inheritor of Abraham, the intimate friend of Allah. Peace be upon you, O inheritor of Moses, the one who spoke to Allah. Peace be upon you, O inheritor of Jesus, the spirit of Allah. Peace be upon you, O inheritor of Muhammad, the beloved of Allah. Peace be upon you, O inheritor of Ali, the Commander of the Faithful and the close friend (Wali) of Allah. Peace be upon you, O inheritor of al-Hasan, the martyr, the grandson of the Messenger of Allah. Peace be upon you, O son of the Messenger of Allah. Peace be upon you, O son of the bearer of glad tidings and warner, and the son of the master of executors. Peace be upon you, O son of Fatima al-Zahra, the leader of the women of the worlds. Peace be upon you, O Aba Abdillah. Peace be upon you, O elite choice of Allah and the son of His elite choice. Peace be upon you, O vengeance of Allah and the son of His vengeance. Peace be upon you, O unique one who was wronged, whose family was slain. Peace be upon you, O guiding and pure Imam, and upon the souls that alighted in your courtyard, stayed in your vicinity, and arrived with your visitors. Peace be upon you from me for as long as I endure and as long as the night and the day remain. Indeed, the calamity through you has become grand, and the grief is momentous among the believers, among the Muslims, among the inhabitants of the heavens entirely, and among the dwellers of the earths. Therefore, indeed we belong to Allah and indeed to Him we shall return. May the blessings of Allah, His bounties, and His greetings be upon you and upon your pure, chosen forefathers, and upon their offspring—the guides, the rightly-guided. Peace be upon you, O my master, and upon them; and upon your soul and upon their souls; and upon your soil and upon their soil. O Allah, grant them mercy, pleasure, comfort, and ease. Peace be upon you, O my master, O Aba Abdillah, O son of the Seal of the Prophets, son of the master of executors, and son of the leader of the women of the worlds. Peace be upon you, O martyr, son of the martyr, brother of the martyr, and father of the martyrs. O Allah, convey to him from me at this hour, on this day, at this moment, and at every moment, abundant greetings and peace. May the peace of Allah, His mercy, and His blessings be upon you, O son of the master of the worlds, and upon those who achieved martyrdom with you—a continuous peace for as long as the night and day are joined. Peace be upon al-Husayn, the son of Ali, the martyr. Peace be upon Ali, the son of al-Husayn, the martyr. Peace be upon Abbas, the son of the Commander of the Faithful, the martyr. Peace be upon the martyrs from the children of the Commander of the Faithful. Peace be upon the martyrs from the children of al-Hasan. Peace be upon the martyrs from the children of al-Husayn. Peace be upon the martyrs from the children of Ja'far and Aqil. Peace be upon every martyr who died with them from among the believers. O Allah, bless Muhammad and the family of Muhammad, and convey to them from me abundant greetings and peace. Peace be upon you, O Messenger of Allah; may Allah make excellent your consolation over your son al-Husayn. Peace be upon you, O Fatima; may Allah make excellent your consolation over your son al-Husayn. Peace be upon you, O Commander of the Faithful; may Allah make excellent your consolation over your son al-Husayn. Peace be upon you, O Aba Muhammad al-Hasan; may Allah make excellent your consolation over your brother al-Husayn. O my master, O Aba Abdillah, I am the guest of Allah and your guest, and the neighbor of Allah and your neighbor. For every guest and neighbor there is hospitality; and my hospitality at this moment is that you ask Allah, Glory be to Him and the Exalted, to grant me the release of my neck from the Fire. Indeed, He is the Hearer of prayers, Near, and Responding."
